  "title": "Baked Gulab Jamun (Indian Dumplings in Syrup)",
  "description": "Baked instead of fried, these Gulab Jamun are sweet, milk-based Indian dumplings soaked in a sugar syrup that make a novel bite-size treat.",
  "authors": [
    "Aegis"
  ],
